            </note>
            <note corresp="#d98-f2" n="2" xml:id="d98-f2-content">
                <p>See telegram no. 274, May 11, 1921, to the Ambassador in Great Britain, <ref
                        target="frus1921v01#pg_14"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>,
                        1921, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, p. 14</ref>.</p>
